{"version":1,"content":"<p>索尼已宣佈旗下Pulse Elevate無線音箱無限期延期發售，此時距離原定上市時間已不足一周。IGN率先發現，索尼於11月6日更新了PlayStation官方博客的首發公告，公佈了這一消息。官方表示，質量檢測過程中發現產品存在「生產問題」，目前暫無新的發售日期。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/music/1585486.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.605799+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T12:30:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"bce63845423ed934382aa2b2456960af165895bcd833c22392b0adb3ea2b1211","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}